       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. COMPUTEROUNDEDDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PRICE       PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 19.99.
       01 QTY         PIC 9(2) VALUE 7.
       01 TAX-RATE    PIC 9V999 VALUE 0.075.
       01 TRUNCATED   PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 ROUNDED-AMT PIC 9(5)V99.
       01 WHOLE-AMT   PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE TRUNCATED = PRICE * QTY * (1 + TAX-RATE)
           COMPUTE ROUNDED-AMT ROUNDED = PRICE * QTY * (1 + TAX-RATE)
           COMPUTE WHOLE-AMT ROUNDED = PRICE * QTY * (1 + TAX-RATE)
           DISPLAY "TRUNCATED: " TRUNCATED
           DISPLAY "ROUNDED:   " ROUNDED-AMT
           DISPLAY "WHOLE:     " WHOLE-AMT
           STOP RUN.
